               3 T fMRI activity was recorded prior to surgery in 11 of these
               participants while performing the same task. This NWB- and
               BIDS-formatted dataset includes spike times, field potential
               activity, behavior, eye tracking, electrode locations,
               demographics, and functional and structural MRI scans. For
