  journal     = "bioRxiv",
  institution = "bioRxiv",
  abstract    = "The mammalian hippocampus contains a cognitive map that
                 represents an animal’s position in the environment 1 and
                 generates offline “replay” 2,3 for the purposes of recall 4 ,
                 planning 5,6 , and forming long term memories 7 . Recently,
                 it’s been found that artificial neural networks trained to
